ion ingredient created exclusively by Purcell. Keeps troubled skin calm and balanced, and smooths out rough, uneven texture for a refined finish. Point 1 – Only 5 ingredients, pure probiotic concentrate. Point 2 – Patented 2 billion/mL high-concentration formula Strengthens fragile and unbalanced skin. Point 3 – Proven barrier improvement for irritated skin Clinically verified soothing and repairing effects on externally stressed skin. [How to use] 1 Apply directly to bare skin after cleansing. 2 Layer at every skincare step for enhanced effect. 3 Blend with your existing skincare products to boost results. [Volume] 30ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #purcell ———————————————————————————————————————————————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ ————————————————————————————————————————————————————', 173.0, 147.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Serum & Essence', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-821ed-mgxa39zhrhu427', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F53951152434', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
